{"productId": "08a1aa60-a6f7-4dc8-b6ca-167e7de33458", "modelName": "BAR MK 4 DBM Speed", "modelDescription": "The roots of the Browning BAR run deep, tracing its history back to John M. Browning's original design for the U.S. military during the First World War. These legendary firearms earned an amazing service record, being used even into the early days of the Vietnam War. The BAR MK 4 has a contemporary design that offers shooters and hunters a lightweight semi-automatic rifle with refinements not present in the most popular modern sporting rifles, including a short-stroke gas-piston design. The BAR MK 4 Speed DBM customizes the BAR design with a detachable box 10-round magazine and magazine well instead of the standard hinged floor plate design. This special DBM model follows in the footsteps of our other guns that share the \"Speed\" moniker. Every Speed firearm is built to be more concealable, durable, and lighter, making them the perfect tools for serious hunters and shooters who need gear as lean and tough as they are. The composite stock features Browning OVIX camouflage, overmolded gripping surfaces, and a raised SoftFlex cheekpad, giving hunters every advantage in the field. ", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "57718ae0-740b-4463-8b1b-033749cfb063", "description": "Browning, BAR MK 4 DBM Speed, Semi Automatic, 308 Winchester, 22\" Barrel, Smoked Bronze Finish, Ovix Camo Composite Stock, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/882b94c7-bed7-49c5-91db-871710d40558", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/191e0991-1e70-459a-9164-c181a33bd3f0"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "039037218", "upc": "023614871293", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5d7cb225-7607-4efe-ad2f-d56197e694de", "attributeName": "Adjustable Stock", "attributeValueId": "f3810c6c-d0fc-424a-81ad-cfaf1f11ff2f", "valueName": "No"}, {"attributeN